---
title: M03 Implemented list-current success path and rejection gates
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Typed caller
    participant B as Shared Bridge
    participant A as Admission policy
    participant T as ListCurrentTask
    participant C as Native client
    participant O as Host filesystem
    U->>B: Typed Envelope + context
    B->>B: Lookup header route
    Note over U,B: Unknown route stops.<br/>No handler called.
    B->>A: admit(header, context)
    A-->>B: Allowed
    Note over B,A: Denial stops here.<br/>Demo flag is not auth.
    B->>B: Compare payload kind
    Note over U,B: Mismatch stops here.<br/>No task or client call.
    B->>T: Binding calls run(())
    T->>C: Prepared List(.)
    Note over T,C: Task prepares request.<br/>Handle acquires client.
    C->>O: Native filesystem calls
    O-->>C: Native data
    C->>C: Sort native entries
    C-->>T: DirectoryListing
    T-->>B: Typed result
    B-->>U: Typed response
    Note over B,O: I/O errors propagate.<br/>No hidden retries.
